          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
                      <div style="text-align: center;">
                       <span style="color:#8e44ad;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><em><strong><span style="font-size:10px;">¡Desplácese hacia abajo para la versión en español de este correo electrónico!<br /> 请向下滚动查看本邮件的西班牙语版本！</span></strong></em></span></span>
                      </div></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><p><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Thank you for signing up for a Zeta event! We missed seeing you and would love another chance to connect.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">We are also happy to share that applications </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>for the 2027-2028 school year are open.</strong>&nbsp;Please take a few minutes to&nbsp;</span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/s/login/SelfRegister?locale=us"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">apply today</span></span></a>!<br /> &nbsp;</p><p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Once you do, your family will be invited to join upcoming events to learn more about Zeta’s next-generation education.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /><br /><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Zeta is a public charter school network that provides a tuition-free, pre-K through high school journey in the Bronx, Manhattan, and Queens. Our whole-child approach combines rigorous academics, expert-led Specialty classes, and a joyful community where students are known and loved. At Zeta, students discover their strengths and passions as they prepare for college and beyond.</span></span></p><p>If you have any questions as you<a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/"> complete your application</a>, please reach out at enroll@zetaschools.org or call us at (646) 480-1654.&nbsp;<br /><br /><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team&nbsp;</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools<br /><span style="color:#dddddd;">___________________________</span></span></span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Hola,</span><p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-right:28px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Gracias por registrarte en el evento de Zeta! Te extrañamos y nos encantaría tener otra oportunidad de conectar.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h1 style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:17px"><span style="line-height:1;"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">También nos complace compartir que las postulaciones para el año escolar 2027-2028 ya están abiertas.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h1><p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:2px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">¡Tómate unos minutos para </span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/">aplicar hoy!</a></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:75px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Una vez que lo hagas, tu familia será invitada a participar en próximos eventos para conocer más sobre la educación de próxima generación de Zeta.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:18px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Lato,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta es una red de escuelas chárter públicas que ofrece una trayectoria educativa gratuita, desde pre-K hasta la escuela secundaria, en el Bronx, Manhattan y Queens. Nuestro enfoque integral combina un riguroso nivel académico, clases especiales dirigidas por expertos y una comunidad alegre donde los estudiantes son conocidos y queridos. En Zeta, los estudiantes descubren sus fortalezas y pasiones mientras se preparan para la universidad y más allá.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><span style="font-family:Tahoma,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Si tiene alguna pregunta, comuníquese con nosotros a enroll@zetaschools.org o llámanos al (646) 480-1654.<br /><br /> Atentamente,<br /><strong>El equipo de admisiones de Zeta</strong><br /> Zeta Charter Schools</span><br /><span style="color:#dddddd;">___________________________</span><br /> &nbsp;</td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
           <tbody>
            <tr valign="top">
             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">
               <tbody>
                <tr>
                 <td>
                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">
                   <tbody>
                    <tr>
                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp; <p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-right:28px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">您好，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> &nbsp; <p style="line-height:1.3800000000000001; margin-right:28px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">感谢您报名参加 Zeta 的活动！今天没能见到您，希望我们还有机会与您交流。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h1 style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:17px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">我们也很高兴地通知您，2027-2028学年的申请现已开放。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h1><p style="line-height:1.2; margin-top:2px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">请花几分钟时间</span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#1154cc"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">立即申请</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> &nbsp; <p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:75px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">一旦申请，您的家庭将受邀参加即将举行的活动，以深入了解 Zeta 的新世代教育。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta 是一个公立特许学校教育网络，在布朗克斯、曼哈顿和皇后区提供从学前班到高中的免费教育。我们秉持全人教育理念，将扎实的学术课程、由专业教师授课的特色课程，以及充满欢乐与关爱的校园氛围融为一体，让每位学生都被了解、被关爱。在 Zeta，学生能够发现自己的优势与热爱，为升入大学及未来的发展做好准备。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:28px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">如果您在</span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://myportal.zetaschools.org/" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#1154cc"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">完成申请过程</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">中遇到任何问题，请通过 </span></span></span></span></span><a href="mailto:enroll@zetaschools.org" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#1154cc"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">enroll@zetaschools.org</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> 与我们联系，或致电 </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#444645"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">(646)</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#444645"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">480-1654</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> &nbsp; <p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:28px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">我们期待着认识您和您的家庭！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style="line-height:1.365; margin-right:28px; margin-top:16px"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">谨此问候，</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h1 style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta 招生团队</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h1><p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Zeta 特许学校</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td>
                    </tr>
                   </tbody>
                  </table></td>
                </tr>
               </tbody>
              </table></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table>
